          "text": " Kojalata EJAKAIT, Edeke loka lukapapaakee, loetolomuni kes kakwap nako Misiri, kosodete atupar icedekesio, luka idekesio luka ituŋa lualukunito kes, kokukonokinos kes: kitunyunyurikisi EJAKAIT. ",
