        {
          "text": " Kinep anyunyura naka EJAKAIT aluikin Isirael, kiiaik kes akan naka ikaŋatak luanasete kes, kogwela kes akan naka lukasurupokec lualukunito, komam bobo epedorete abwoikin lukasurupokec. ",
