              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye naetwania ekatubon, kobononorete, kiswamaenenete nueroko noi adepar lukapapaakee kotoma atupit ieedekesio aijaanakin kes, ka akukonokin kes; mam apotu kopalut aswam nun karaida eponekee loka aninik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
