              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kinep anyunyura naka EJAKAIT’ aluikin Isirael; kotema atiar, “Naarai ebuea ateker na akaitutuket naabu keeorak lukapapaakee, mam erimarito ekaporoto; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.20",
